      <abstract>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Implementation of SH-2(A) Linux kernel&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA; </abstract>
      <description>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Yoshinori ported linux-2.6 to SH-2 and SH-2A processors of Renesas Technorogy.&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;SH-3 and SH-4 were supported in the past, but SH-2 needed to be implemented because the architecture was different from those processors.&#xA;Yoshinori will introduce his implementation for SH-2 equivalence mainly on such a part.&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA; </description>
